    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a world divided by the enigmatic Spheres, where different races live under strict balance \u2013 a balance that has never been questioned\u2026 until now.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the protagonist, an ordinary young person from a remote village, you receive an unexpected invitation to a grand ball. What seems like a stroke of fate soon turns into a revelation of hidden anomalies, ancient powers, and a secret that could shatter reality itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But you are not alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet intriguing characters from various races, each carrying their own secrets, struggles, and desires. Will they become your allies, rivals, or something more? Your choices will shape their destinies \u2013 and your own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2728 Deep, branching narrative \u2013 Unravel the mysteries of the world and shape your fate through meaningful choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc96 Romance and relationships \u2013 Build deep bonds, develop friendships, or ignite rivalries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfad Intrigue and mystery \u2013 Every conversation and action holds a piece of the puzzle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udecd\ufe0f Customization \u2013 Choose your gender and outfit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfbc Atmospheric soundtrack \u2013 Let the music immerse you in the emotions of each moment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2696\ufe0f Multiple endings \u2013 Will you restore balance, break the system, or reshape the world entirely?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae Mini-games \u2013 Engage in exciting mini-games that offer additional challenges and help unveil hidden aspects of the characters and the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Volume 1 Launch:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Begin your journey with Volume 1 \u2013 available now! Stay tuned for regular updates that will expand the narrative, introduce new characters, mini-games, and reveal deeper secrets of the Spheres.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The boundaries of reality are fragile. What lies beyond them?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only you can decide.</p>",
